1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Given the lack of archeological evidence from this period of prehistory, there is some uncertainty as to how many generations are between Si Gun and Zhuan Xu:
2 CONT
2 CONT According to a [http://www.geni.com/documents/view/6000000002920088413?doc_id=6000000026607256162 Wu Cheng Zeng Family Genealogy (Page 25)] and a [http://photos.geni.com/p13/58/d0/b5/0f/5344483c610512f5/ger52huq_original.jpg Chen 
2 CONC Family Genealogy], Si Gun is the son of Zhuan Xu. There are no intervening generations as indicated in Geni.com.
2 CONT
2 CONT Other historical sources, indicate that there my be up to 3 generations between Si Gun and Zhuan Xu, for example: http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Family_tree_of_ancient_Chinese_emperors.
