1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Ji Ju''' - From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Ju''' (Chinese: 鞠) was a noble of the Xia.
2 CONT
2 CONT Born '''Ji Ju''' (姬鞠), he is reported as having abandoned the agriculture of his father Buzhu and grandfather Houji in favor of the animal husbandry practiced by the Rong and Di barbarians.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT His son was Duke Liu, from whom the Zhou royal family descended.
2 CONT
2 CONT Source: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ji_Ju
2 CONT
2 CONT References
2 CONT # Sima Qian. Records of the Grand Historian. Source: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Records_of_the_Grand_Historian
