1 NOTE  Zaofu  was the first person to hold the surname
2 CONT  Zhao .
2 CONT  He was the chauffer to Zhou Mu Wang (1001-946 B.C.).
2 CONT  The name Zhao  was originally that of a city-state in
2 CONT  Shanxi  province,
2 CONT  which was awarded to Zaofu  by Zhou Mu Wang,
2 CONT  after Zaofu  rescued him during a rebellion.  Because of this
2 CONT  act, Zaofu  is called "the loyal chauffer".
