2 CONT
2 CONT Gu Gong 亶 father, Ji surname, name 亶 (dǎn), also known as Zhou Taiwang, also known as Zhou Dawang, 豳 (bīn, now Shaanxi Xunyi) people.
2 CONT
2 CONT The outstanding leader of the ancient Zhou people, the Xibo monarch,King Wen of ZhouGrandfather, the founder of the Zhou Dynasty.Zhou Wu Wang Ji FaestablishZhou Dynasty, posthumously named him "King Zhou".
2 CONT
2 CONT It is estimated that Gu Gong's father is the 15th grandson of Xuanyuan Yellow Emperor and the ancestor of ZhouHoujiThe 12th grandson, in the history of the development of the Zhou people, is a key figure in the great cause of Houj
2 CONC i and Gongliu, and the prosperity of King Qiwen and King Wu, and is a far-sighted politician, reformer, military strategist, and a famous virtuous king in history. Gu Gong's father, because of Rong Di's coercion, led his clan to m
2 CONC ove from Feng to the foot of QishanZhou Yuan(now Qishanbei, Shaanxi), "the restoration of Houji, Gongliu's industry", the implementation of the agricultural development policy of "farming and weaving, the land is appropriate", to 
2 CONC achieve the situation of "the traveler has capital, the resident has livestock, and the people rely on its celebration", and the Zhou nationality gradually became stronger.
