1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 27th generation. Approximately 1500 BC to _____. Son of Ru Hong (汝鸿).
2 CONT
2 CONT Born prematurely after a 215-day gestation . Lived during the Shang (商) Dynasty.
2 CONT
2 CONT Father of Zhu Tu (主土).
2 CONT
2 CONT 二十七世。约公元前1500 ---。汝鸿之子, 主土之父。居黄州黄冈县 (今湖北黄冈县), 受封黄冈伯。
2 CONT
