2 CONT
2 CONT Marquis Li of Jin (Chinese: 晉厲侯; pinyin: Jìn Lì Hóu), personal name Ji Fu, was a monarch of the Jin state. He succeeded his father, Marquis Cheng, to the Jin throne.
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1992, an ancient tomb dating back to the Zhou dynasty was discovered in Quwo County, Shanxi. One of the tombs was marked as the tomb of Marquis Li of Jin. Quwo County is known to be the site of the ancient capital of the state 
2 CONC of Jin.
2 CONT
2 CONT Marquis Li was succeeded by his son, Marquis Jing.
