2 CONT
2 CONT The generations from Zujia (祖甲) to Bei (惫) are recorded in the Rites of Worship of Shaohao (金天祝宗法誌).
2 CONT
2 CONT Father of Fu Ya Fu (弗亚父).
2 CONT
2 CONT 三十六世。约公元前260 ---。彤之子, 弗亚父之父。商朝时封大祝, 迁历正, 掌帮国志。
