1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''The 27th Ancestor: 花三 (Huā Sān)'''
2 CONT
2 CONT He was the 镇宁 (Zhèn Níng) vassal of the 商 (Shāng) Dynasty. His wife, 梅 (Méi) gave birth to five sons named 羅生 (Luó Shēng), 發貴 (Fā Guì), 爲文 (Wèi Wén), 傳東 (Chuán Dōng) and 廣田 (Guǎng Tián).
