1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 43rd generation. Approximately 1070 BC to _____. Son of Xue (觷)/Yin Que (音確).
2 CONT
2 CONT The name was supposed to mean the "first to be born in Jiang Xia" (江夏).
2 CONT
2 CONT Lived during the early Western Zhou (西周初) period.
2 CONT
2 CONT Father of Zhong Li (中立).
2 CONT
2 CONT 四十三世。约公元前1070 ---。音確之子, 中立之父。周初江夏人。武王 (公元前1046) 克商, 都方于镐京 (今陕西西安府)。
2 CONT
2 CONT “元 (王) 所”, 元, 第一 : 所, 指江夏的地方。是第一个在江夏出生的人。 
2 CONT
2 CONT SOURCES (资料来源) -
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Wen Ming Zu Jia Pu (文明祖家谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Huang Shi Ying Zuo Fang Yuan Qu Wu Hao Zhi Pu (黄氏英佐房园趣无号支谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. 黄守恭 - 百度百科.
2 CONT
2 CONT 4. 黄正瑞的博客.
