1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''The 33rd Ancestor: 福任 (Fú Rèn)''' 
2 CONT
2 CONT He was born in 1419 BC. He was the 骑都尉 (Qí Dū Wèi). His tomb was located at the South of 南山 (Nán Shān), Haodi,  商丘 (Shāng Qiū), 河南 (Hénán).
2 CONT
2 CONT His wife, 双 (Shuāng) had two sons named 仁才 (Rén Cái) and 仁發 (Rén Fā) and a daughter. She was buried at the East of 定馬山 (Dìng Mǎ Shān).
