1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''The 37th Ancestor: 仕水 (Shì Shuǐ)'''
2 CONT
2 CONT He was born in 1289 BC. He was the 保宁侯 (Bǎo Níng Hóu).
2 CONT
2 CONT His tomb was located at the North of 蝦公嶺 (Xiā Gōng Lǐng). No record shows where his wives were buried.
2 CONT
2 CONT His wives were 任 (Rèn) and 印 (Yìn), neither of them have children. They adopted 仕幸 (Shì Xìng)'s son, 宏權 (Hóng Quán) as their own child. 
