1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''The 39th Ancestor: 榮華 (Róng Huá)'''
2 CONT
2 CONT He was born in 1221 BC. He was the 大相國 (Dà Xiāng Guó). His tomb was located at the South of 眞龍 (Zhēn Lóng) Mountain. 
2 CONT
2 CONT His wife, 尹 (Yǐn), have three sons named 亞連 (Yà Lián), 春慶 (Chūn Qìng), 木養 (Mù Yǎng) and two daughters. She was buried at the East of 獅子崗 (Shī Zi Gǎng).
