1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 53rd generation. Approximately 800 BC to _____. Son of Kao (考).
2 CONT
2 CONT An Education Minister (司徒) during the Eastern Zhou (东周)/Spring-Autumn (春秋) period.
2 CONT
2 CONT Father of Shi Mi (世宓).
2 CONT
2 CONT 五十三世。约公元前800 ---。考之子, 世宓之父。东周/春秋时期为大司徒。
2 CONT
2 CONT 君牙的名字代表君主的地位如牙齿一样牢固, 孩子聪明如牙璋一样宝贵。
2 CONT
2 CONT SOURCES (资料来源) -
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Wen Ming Zu Jia Pu (文明祖家谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Huang Shi Ying Zuo Fang Yuan Qu Wu Hao Zhi Pu (黄氏英佐房园趣无号支谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 3.  黄守恭 - 百度百科.
2 CONT
2 CONT 4.  黄正瑞的博客.
