1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 56th generation. Approximately 750 BC to _____. Son of Xing (铏). 
2 CONT
2 CONT An Imperial Investigative Court Official (畿内闾正) during the Eastern Zhou (东周)/Spring-Autumn (春秋) period.
2 CONT
2 CONT Father of Jian (囏).
2 CONT
2 CONT 五十六世。约公元前750 ---。铏之子, 囏之父。东周/春秋时期为畿内闾正 (胥), 时周室东迁 (公元前770) 洛邑 (今河南洛阳县) 是为东周。
2 CONT
2 CONT SOURCES (资料来源) -
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Wen Ming Zu Jia Pu (文明祖家谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Huang Shi Ying Zuo Fang Yuan Qu Wu Hao Zhi Pu (黄氏英佐房园趣无号支谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 3.  黄守恭 - 百度百科.
2 CONT
2 CONT 4.  黄正瑞的博客.
