1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''The 49th Generation Ancestor: 平南 (Píng Nán)'''
2 CONT
2 CONT He was born in 940 BC was a vassal of the Western Zhou Dynasty.
2 CONT
2 CONT His wife, 袁 (Yuán), had three sons. They were 員餘 (Yuán Yú) whose courtesy name was 子彬 (Zi Bīn), 員安 (Yuán ān) whose courtesy name was 子潘 (Zi Pān), and 員有 (Yuán Yǒu) whose courtesy name was 子俊 (Zi Jùn). 
