1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''The 51st Ancestor: 日龍 (Rì Lóng)'''
2 CONT
2 CONT He was born in 889 BC, 西周 (Xī Zhōu) Dynasty. He was the governor of the Tan vassal county.
2 CONT
2 CONT His wife, Ms. Mi, had three sons named 月可 (Yuè Kě), 月機 (Yuè Jī), and 月觀 (Yuè Guān), and a daughter. She is buried at the east of 印水 (Yìn Shuǐ) with her husband.
