1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 64th generation. Approximately 550 BC to _____. Son of Chui (垂).
2 CONT
2 CONT A Frontier Captain (羌校尉) during the Eastern Zhou (东周)/Warring States (战国) period.
2 CONT
2 CONT Father of Chi (炽).
2 CONT
2 CONT 六十四世。 约公元前550 ---。垂之子, 炽之父。东周/战国时期为攘羌校尉。
2 CONT
2 CONT 息, 小儿也。息, 安也, 又生也。希望儿子能像息壤一样, 能长息无限地发展。
2 CONT
2 CONT SOURCES (资料来源) -
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Wen Ming Zu Jia Pu (文明祖家谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Huang Shi Ying Zuo Fang Yuan Qu Wu Hao Zhi Pu (黄氏英佐房园趣无号支谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. 黄守恭 - 百度百科.
2 CONT
2 CONT 4. 黄正瑞的博客.
