1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''The 53rd Ancestor: 草立 (Cǎo Lì)'''
2 CONT
2 CONT He was born in 836 BC, during the XiZhou Dynasty. He was the governor of the Tan vassal county. He was buried in the south of 仙人嶺 (Xiān Rén Lǐng), 王馬莊 (Wáng Mǎ Zhuāng) with his wife.
2 CONT
2 CONT His wife, 鄧 (Dèng), gave birth to four sons named 木元 (Mù Yuán), 木安 (Mù ān), 木義 (Mù  Yì), 木文 (Mù Wén).
