1 CONT           o Prince Liu Wu (??), initially of Dai (created 178 BC), then of Huaiyang (created 175 BC), then of Liang (created 169 BC) (d. 144 BC), known as Prince Xiao of Liang
1 CONT           o Prince Liu Can (??), initially of Taiyuan (created 178 BC), later of Dai (created 175 BC) (d. 161 BC), known as Prince Xiao of Dai
1 CONT           o Prince Liu Yi (??) of Liang (d. 169 BC), of a fall from a horse, known as Prince Huai of Liang
1 CONT           o Princess Changping
1 CONT           o Liu Piao (??), the Princess Guantao
1 CONT
