1 CONT
1 CONT     * Jianyuan (?? py. jiàn yuán) 140 BC-135 BC
1 CONT     * Yuanguang (?? py. yuán guang) 134 BC-129 BC
1 CONT     * Yuanshuo (?? py. yuán shuò) 128 BC-123 BC
1 CONT     * Yuanshou (?? py. yuán shòu) 122 BC-117 BC
1 CONT     * Yuanding (?? py. yuán ding) 116 BC-111 BC
1 CONT     * Yuanfeng (?? py. yuán feng) 110 BC-105 BC
1 CONT     * Taichu (?? py. tài chu) 104 BC-101 BC
1 CONT     * Tianhan (?? py. tian hàn) 100 BC-97 BC
1 CONT     * Taishi (?? py. tài shi) 96 BC-93 BC
1 CONT     * Zhenghe (?? py. zheng hé) 92 BC-89 BC
